{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/DevOps Agent Architecture.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/DevOps Agent Architecture.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"dev ops agent architecture dev ops agent architecture","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/DevOps Agent Architecture.md","fileName":"DevOps Agent Architecture.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"DevOps Agent Architecture","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[DevOps Agent Safety and Autonomy]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["DevOps Agent Safety and Autonomy","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/DevOps Agent Architecture.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/DevOps Agent Architecture.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"dev ops agent architecture dev ops agent architecture","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/DevOps Agent Architecture.md","fileName":"DevOps Agent Architecture.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"DevOps Agent Architecture","heading":"DevOps Agent Architecture","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A DevOps agent combines a language-model reasoning engine with a planning layer, scoped memory, external tools, and self-checks. The reasoning engine interprets input and proposes output; planning decides what context or tool is needed; memory retains relevant state; tools interact with systems; and validation checks the result.\n\nThis architecture differs from a single model response because it can gather evidence and participate in a workflow. The surrounding application must therefore define timeouts, allowed tools, stop conditions, output contracts, and approval requirements before the agent is permitted to influence delivery or operations.","tags":["baby"],"links":["DevOps Agent Safety and Autonomy","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/DevOps Agent Architecture.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/DevOps Agent Architecture.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"dev ops agent architecture dev ops agent architecture","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/DevOps Agent Architecture.md","fileName":"DevOps Agent Architecture.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"DevOps Agent Architecture","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["DevOps Agent Safety and Autonomy","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}